# WickTheorem::max_ops(n): with full_contractions(false), do not emit partial
# contractions that leave more than n operators uncontracted (they are still
# contracted further). Equals filtering the result afterwards, but avoids forming
# the high-rank intermediate terms (e.g. DUCC level-3 commutators with triples).
